    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "The best kept secret to Lake Tahoe\nHOLIDAY\nAIRLINES\nFLIGHT SCHEDULE\nEffective October 5, 1970\nSubject to change without notice",
      "Yippee!\nTo Lake Tahoe\nAll flights non-stop unless otherwise indicated\nLOS ANGELES (LAX) to LAKE TAHOE\nFLT\n9*\n1\n7\n5\nLV\n9:00A\n6:00P\n7: 15P\n8:00P\nAR\n10:40A\n7:20P\n8:35P\n9:20P\nFREQUENCY\nDaily\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun.\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\nALL FLIGHTS LEAVE LOS ANGELES (LAX)\nFROM WEST IMPERIAL TERMINAL.\nHOLLYWOOD-BURBANK (HWB) to LAKE TAHOE\nFLT\nLV\nAR\nFREQUENCY\n9\n9:30 A\n10:40A\nDaily\n741\n3:45P\n4:55P\nSun. Only\n541\n4:45P\n5:55P\nFri. Only\nSAN JOSE (SJC) to LAKE TAHOE\nFLT\nLV\nAR\nFREQUENCY\n20*\n11:50A\n1:00P\nDaily\n22\n6:25P\n7:05P\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun.\n544\n7:45P\n8:25P\nFri. Only\nOAKLAND (OAK) to LAKE TAHOE\nFLT\nLV\nAR\nFREQUENCY\n20\n22*\n734\n544*\n*T STOP\n12:25P\n6:00P\n6:45P\n7: 15P\n1:00P\n7:05P\n7:20P\n8:25P\nDaily\nEx. Fri \u0026 Sun.\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\nYuk!\nFrom Lake Tahoe\nAll flights non-stop unless otherwise indicated\nLAKE TAHOE to LOS ANGELES\nFLT\n42*\n76\n56\n4\n74\n58\nLV\n1:30P\n5:25P\n6: 15P\n7:45P\n8:00P\n10:00P\nAR\n3:10P\n6:45P\n7:35P\n9:05P\n9:20P\n11:20P\nFREQUENCY\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun.\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun.\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\nALL FLIGHTS ARRIVE AT LOS ANGELES\n(LAX) AT WEST IMPERIAL TERMINAL\nLAKE TAHOE to HOLLYWOOD-BURBANK\nFLT\n42\n740\nLV\n1:30P\n2:00P\nAR\nFREQUENCY\n2:40P\n3:10P\nEx. Sun.\nSun. Only\nLAKE TAHOE to SAN JOSE\nFLT\nLV\nAR\n21\n23\n725\n543\n11:00A\n8:00P\n9:00P\n9:45P\n11:40A\n8:40P\n9:40P\n10:25P\nFREQUENCY\nDaily\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\n-AKE TAHOE to OAKLAND\nFLT\nLV\nAR\nFREQUENCY\n21*\n23*\n725*\n543*\n*1 STOP\n11:00A\n8:00P\n9:00P\n9:45P\n12:05P\n9:05P\n10:05P\n10:50P\nDaily\nEx. Fri. \u0026 Sun.\nSun. Only\nFri. Only\nFOR INFORMATION AND RESERVATIONS PLEASE TELEPHONE:\nOakland: (415) 562-8550\nSan Jose: (408) 286-1500\nTahoe: (916) 541-4150\nSan Francisco: (415) 391-8090\nLos Angeles: (213) 461-2931\nEffective November 1, 1970 Los Angeles will change to: (213) 776-1800\nBurbank: (213) 849-2701 and Beverly Hills: (213) 276-8670"
    ],
